				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					10.516
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. στείχειν, παρεῖναι,
			παραστατεῖν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				877
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				83
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				669
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ π</span>. (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄντες</span>) <i>one's neighbours</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Democr.
				293
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antipho Soph.
				58
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.97
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Critias
				15.6
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i> , <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.69
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.78
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				92
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1169a14
			</span></i>, etc. ; <i>one's fellow creatures</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Heracl.</u>
				2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
