				441
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τῶν πέλας κακά</span>,
			opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ οἰκήϊα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.152
			</span></i> : sg. , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ π</span>. <i>one's
				neighbour</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.142
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.32
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾶς τις αὑτὸν τοῦ π. μᾶλλον φιλεῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Med.</u>
					86
				</span></i>
			 ; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλησίον</span>.
			</div>
